      "content": "i mean i know i should check with them but my doctor is impossible to reach and i'm literally suffering right now lol. is it really that big of a deal? like would a regular dose actually do anything to my blood pressure or is that just a standard disclaimer they give everyone? i just need some relief so i can sleep",
